{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI Workplace Monitoring.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI Workplace Monitoring.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai workplace monitoring ai workplace monitoring","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI Workplace Monitoring.md","fileName":"AI Workplace Monitoring.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI Workplace Monitoring","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI Labor and Environmental Ethics]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Labor and Environmental Ethics","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI Workplace Monitoring.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI Workplace Monitoring.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai workplace monitoring ai workplace monitoring","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI Workplace Monitoring.md","fileName":"AI Workplace Monitoring.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI Workplace Monitoring","heading":"AI Workplace Monitoring","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"AI workplace monitoring uses data and automated analysis to observe employees, evaluate performance, or predict behavior. Continuous measurement can turn ordinary activity into a source of managerial judgment while employees have little knowledge of or control over the model.\n\nThe practice affects privacy, autonomy, and power at work. A numerical score may ignore context while encouraging workers to optimize visible metrics rather than perform meaningful tasks. Ethical use requires a legitimate purpose, proportionate collection, intelligible criteria, and a way to challenge errors. Worker participation is necessary because apparent consent may not be meaningful within an unequal employment relationship.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Labor and Environmental Ethics","aiethics.epub"],"p